1	# Design Language: DEON LIBRA
2	
3	> Extracted from `https://deonlibra.com` on September 4, 2026
4	> 1508 elements analyzed
5	
6	This document describes the complete design language of the website. It is structured for AI/LLM consumption — use it to faithfully recreate the visual design in any framework.
7	
8	## Color Palette
9	
10	### Primary Colors
11	
12	| Role | Hex | RGB | HSL | Usage Count |
13	|------|-----|-----|-----|-------------|
14	| Primary | `#c00121` | rgb(192, 1, 33) | hsl(350, 99%, 38%) | 80 |
15	| Secondary | `#fff8e7` | rgb(255, 248, 231) | hsl(42, 100%, 95%) | 1480 |
16	| Accent | `#146ff8` | rgb(20, 111, 248) | hsl(216, 94%, 53%) | 3 |
17	
18	### Neutral Colors
19	
20	| Hex | HSL | Usage Count |
21	|-----|-----|-------------|
22	| `#000000` | hsl(0, 0%, 0%) | 1457 |
23	| `#ffffff` | hsl(0, 0%, 100%) | 47 |
24	| `#66635c` | hsl(42, 5%, 38%) | 12 |
