69	| `#fee9e8` | background | 1 |
70	
71	## Typography
72	
73	### Font Families
74	
75	- **Inter** — used for body (1200 elements)
76	- **Times New Roman** — used for body (129 elements)
77	- **Anton** — used for all (108 elements)
78	- **Arial** — used for body (68 elements)
79	- **GTStandard-M** — used for body (2 elements)
80	- **Roboto** — used for body (1 elements)
81	
82	### Type Scale
83	
84	| Size (px) | Size (rem) | Weight | Line Height | Letter Spacing | Used On |
85	|-----------|------------|--------|-------------|----------------|---------|
86	| 60px | 3.75rem | 400 | 72px | -2.4px | h2, motion-element, highlight-text-image |
87	| 48px | 3rem | 400 | 60px | -1.92px | highlight-text-image, h2, motion-element, strong |
88	| 40px | 2.5rem | 400 | 48px | -1.6px | h1, h3 |
